        "title": "Wikipedia Browser Template Design",
        "summary": "Design a reusable Twilite template rather than a single special-purpose node. The first pass centers on two semantic roles: an article-source root and expandable section nodes. The template should prove spatial browsing of one real Wikipedia article before adding references, infoboxes, categories, images, or deeper knowledge ingestion.",
        "status": "active",
        "definitionKey": "summary",
        "_classBinding": {
